# A quadratically constrained problem, written by hand:
#   min x + y  s.t.  x^2 + y^2 <= 2,  x and y free
# The constraint Q entries follow the 1/2 convention: (2 x^2 + 2 y^2) / 2.
eqcon
LCQ
minimize
2          # variables
1          # constraints
1.0        # default objective coefficient
0          # non-default objective coefficients
0.0        # objective constant
2          # constraint Q entries
1 1 1 2.0
1 2 2 2.0
0          # constraint entries
1e+20      # value for infinity
-1e+20     # default constraint lower bound
0
2.0        # default constraint upper bound
0
-1e+20     # default variable lower bound
0
1e+20      # default variable upper bound
0
0.0        # default initial primal
0
0.0        # default initial dual
0
0.0        # default initial reduced cost
0
2          # variable names
1 x
2 y
1          # constraint names
1 ball
